    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a apocalyptic world where people starve to death while being chased by hordes of zombies, you provide food with the left over ingridients to feed people with your cooking skill even rotten food feels like a delightful meal, the government takes interest in your capability and taking your family as hostage to work you till death comes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor start coming around to taste out your cooking and your duty is to satify them and the government to survive in this apocalyptic world!<br><br><strong>COOK THE MEAL!</strong><br>Cook the meal as the customer ordered flawlessly within the right propotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/0de3879e05f561fc8b92174e56166634.poster.avif?t=1743747760\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/0de3879e05f561fc8b92174e56166634.webm?t=1743747760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/0de3879e05f561fc8b92174e56166634.mp4?t=1743747760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br><strong>PREPARE THE DISH!</strong> <br>Put those nasty cooked ingridient to the customer plate with the right preparation as the recipe book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/fb96634fb6da9b8ad05a6c89a1d541cb.poster.avif?t=1743747760\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/fb96634fb6da9b8ad05a6c89a1d541cb.webm?t=1743747760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/fb96634fb6da9b8ad05a6c89a1d541cb.mp4?t=1743747760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SHOWOFF AND SERVE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip and taunt those food to the customer to amaze them and get extra credits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/5b155ae77082a7a60696922166fec995.poster.avif?t=1743747760\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/5b155ae77082a7a60696922166fec995.webm?t=1743747760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/5b155ae77082a7a60696922166fec995.mp4?t=1743747760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>WATCH YOUR BACK!</strong><br>Beware of your surrounding and watch your back through the camera for the upcoming hordes, you don't want any zombies lurking around behind your customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/36ec393c59cc7113d073e46beee60f20.poster.avif?t=1743747760\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/36ec393c59cc7113d073e46beee60f20.webm?t=1743747760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595640/extras/36ec393c59cc7113d073e46beee60f20.mp4?t=1743747760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get credits from each meal you serve and pay the goverment to keep your family alive while upgrading your fortress for the next day, each day going to get harder by the time and your need to upgrade it with the spare credits you got from the day.</p>",
